      "id": "migration-bool-notnull",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Migration/Version1000Date20260804120000.php:99 leg_votes.secret, in Nextcloud 32",
        "lib/Migration/Version3000Date20260804160000.php:67 leg_calendar.active, in Nextcloud 32",
        "lib/Migration/Version5000Date20260804210000.php:49 leg_attendance.present, in Nextcloud 32",
        "lib/Migration/Version6000Date20260804230000.php:33 leg_parliamentarians.active, in Nextcloud 32"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "4 boolean columns are NotNull. Oracle cannot store false in such a column, so the server stops the migration with an exception. A boolean column needs notnull false.",
        "  Up to Nextcloud 32 the server checks this only where info.xml lists no database, or lists oci among them. From Nextcloud 33 on the server makes the column nullable on Oracle itself.",
        "  lib/Migration/Version1000Date20260804120000.php:99 leg_votes.secret, in Nextcloud 32",
        "  lib/Migration/Version3000Date20260804160000.php:67 leg_calendar.active, in Nextcloud 32",
        "  lib/Migration/Version5000Date20260804210000.php:49 leg_attendance.present, in Nextcloud 32",
        "  lib/Migration/Version6000Date20260804230000.php:33 leg_parliamentarians.active, in Nextcloud 32"
      ],
      "folds": [
        {
          "at": 5,
          "count": 1
        }
      ]
